# 文本文件统一 LF 行尾（.ps1 例外见下）
* text=auto eol=lf

# PowerShell 脚本：本机是 PowerShell 5.1，必须 UTF-8 with BOM，
# 且用 CRLF 打印更符合 Windows 习惯；让 git 原样处理二进制避免 BOM 被改写
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.iss text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件：不做行尾转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.jks binary
*.keystore binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.zip binary
*.apk binary
*.sqlite binary

# 明确文本类型
*.cs text
